-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The Wendigo have one caern complete with sept and<br /> protectorate, located near the shores of the Bering Sea .<br /> There are 30 Wendigo there . From here, they will attack<br /> any minion of the Wyrm or, indeed, anyone who gets too<br /> near . They have not been attacked as yet, nor do they know<br /> of the attacks on other caerns . It is possible that their<br /> isolationism will prove to be their downfall . </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Then there are the Siberakh, who also are just but a few, but they are not really wendigos.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","user":"Undead rabbit","date":". 09-22-2016, 03:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T12:42:09-07:00","id":974601,"title":"","content":"That's what I thought. Hundreds is big number for Garou. They assembled a Thousand Garou for the Final Battle in Russia and lost 500 but wiped out Baba Yaga's forces.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T21:30:40-07:00","id":974875,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_post